     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">I would like to\r\nstart using INLA remotely on our cluster in the basement called shorea. I am\r\nusing windows, and I have followed the set up the FAQ page of the inla\r\nwebsite but it cannot seem to figure it out. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Using windows,\r\nso far I have done:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"></p><ul><li>Downloaded\r\nCygwin and all extra file with ssh in<br></li><li>Ran the\r\n“ssh-keygen” in Cygwin and set up the file and used my password<br></li><li>Ran\r\n“<a href=\"http://inla.ssh.copy.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://inla.ssh.copy.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792444630529000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ut9IUpIMDok9be8VqM1p9\">inla.ssh.copy.id</a>()” in R<br></li><li>Copied the\r\nreturned address and pasted it into Cygwin<br></li><li>Added\r\nuser...@shorea.abcd.xy<br></li><li>Agree I want\r\nto connect to shorea</li></ul><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">      The procedure\r\nnow finishes, there are no errors etc, and tells me that I have permanently added\r\nshorea to the list of known hosts and then asks for my password. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Now I bounce\r\nback to R and run my model with inla.call = “submit” </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">r &lt;-\r\ninla(y ~ f(x1, model = &quot;linear&quot;), data = dt, inla.call =\r\n&quot;submit&quot;) <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">            </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b>Submit job [Fri-Nov-11-11-18-26-2016---248562746] at host\r\n<a href=\"http://inla.math.ntnu.no\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://inla.math.ntnu.no&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792444630529000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XJnoZ8eMc4jaBPcnAMcKZ\">inla.math.ntnu.no</a> &lt;- is this correct??</b><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">usage: ssh\r\n[-1246AaCfGgKkMNnqsTtVvXxYy] [-b bind_address] [-c cipher_spec]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">   \r\n       [-D [bind_address:]port] [-E log_file] [-e\r\nescape_char]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">   \r\n       [-F configfile] [-I pkcs11] [-i identity_file]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">   \r\n       [-J [user@]host[:port]] [-L address] [-l login_name]\r\n[-m mac_spec]<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">   \r\n       [-O ctl_cmd] [-o option] [-p port] [-Q query_option]\r\n[-R address]<u></u><u><